This page was written before
.Nm
and describes how it is meant to work.
Until the Rust firmware reaches milestone 4, the adapter runs firmware
without the configuration interface, and
.Nm
cannot find it.
.Sh BUGS
The USB ID 1209:0001 is a test ID and will change before release.
